01:27:19.289 --> 01:27:23.310
and valid criticisms are heard and not ignored by the

01:27:23.810 --> 01:27:25.160
people who make the decisions.

01:27:26.810 --> 01:27:30.690
To my knowledge, the Region has successfully housed

01:27:31.190 --> 01:27:34.670
the original residents who first moved into the encampment.

01:27:35.260 --> 01:27:39.300
Ongoing outreach has resulted in a revolving door

01:27:39.800 --> 01:27:43.579
of newcomers, meaning none of the current residents

01:27:44.079 --> 01:27:47.780
are from the original group. The current situation

01:27:48.280 --> 01:27:51.520
is not an affordable housing crisis at the

01:27:52.020 --> 01:27:56.040
encampment. No one missed a rent payment and no one's going to buy a

01:27:56.540 --> 01:28:00.040
house. In my eyes, the situation is unfortunately

01:28:00.540 --> 01:28:04.583
driven by mental illness and addiction. Giving people

01:28:04.615 --> 01:28:08.580
apartments with no inside support system

01:28:09.591 --> 01:28:12.882
is reckless and dangerous. The results

01:28:13.382 --> 01:28:17.265
are always the same: crime, violence, and tragedy.

01:28:18.100 --> 01:28:20.925
The answer is not a sanctioned encampment.

01:28:21.632 --> 01:28:25.613
Accountability creates agency, and impunity

01:28:25.886 --> 01:28:29.463
destroys agency. Supportive housing

01:28:29.655 --> 01:28:33.422
is a crisis and must be addressed and resolved.

01:28:34.287 --> 01:28:38.022
Valued time is wasted on egos and creates

01:28:38.231 --> 01:28:39.962
political exhaustion.

01:28:41.180 --> 01:28:45.027
Approximately $2 million spent on the encampment

01:28:45.524 --> 01:28:48.986
and there is no supportive housing, and 4 years have

01:28:49.050 --> 01:28:52.368
passed by. Our people with mental

01:28:52.576 --> 01:28:56.890
illness and addiction are rotting outside on the sidewalk,

01:28:57.750 --> 01:29:02.629
holding tight a lighter and a government taxpayer-funded

01:29:03.129 --> 01:29:07.870
pipe and tin foil. Critical thinking lost to addiction.

01:29:08.370 --> 01:29:11.670
I witness daily people wandering into traffic,

01:29:12.170 --> 01:29:15.250
yelling into the air, shirtless,

01:29:15.750 --> 01:29:19.430
shoeless, a danger to themselves and to the public. We have a

01:29:19.930 --> 01:29:23.610
shared moral responsibility to keep our community safe

01:29:23.962 --> 01:29:27.391
and healthy. We must all try harder and

01:29:27.471 --> 01:29:29.458
we must do better. Thank you.

01:29:31.798 --> 01:29:35.660
Thank you, Lorraine. I see no questions, but thank you for delegating. The next

01:29:36.160 --> 01:29:38.272
